WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.188 
(Suggestion Box) (Eagerly...)

00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:05.236 
Huh?

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:06.880 
A suggestion box?

00:00:07.004 --> 00:00:08.416 
We have one of those?

00:00:08.593 --> 00:00:09.549 
Yep.

00:00:09.656 --> 00:00:11.503 
I look forward to reading it every month.

00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:13.011 
I wonder how many we'll get.

00:00:13.287 --> 00:00:14.252 
Here goes!

00:00:18.678 --> 00:00:20.042 
Two submissions?

00:00:20.893 --> 00:00:22.258 
There are tons!

00:00:22.282 --> 00:00:23.962 
Oh, so that's how it works?

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:27.978 
(Episode 4: Komaro and the Suggestion Box)

00:00:28.305 --> 00:00:29.950 
It's usually like this?

00:00:30.134 --> 00:00:34.054 
Yeah. Usually zero or one.
We got three this month!

00:00:34.219 --> 00:00:37.212 
Well, we only put the box up this year.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:39.107 
I actually made the box myself.

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:40.872 
(Today's Pattern)
Oh, I see.

00:00:40.896 --> 00:00:42.730 
Then why introduce it this year?

00:00:42.963 --> 00:00:43.950 
Well...

00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:47.390 
the official reason was to make the
Student Council more open and approachable.

00:00:47.843 --> 00:00:50.172 
(Suggestion Box)
And to give Komaro something to do.

00:00:50.196 --> 00:00:51.259 
I see...

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.236 
I wonder what people wrote.

00:00:53.356 --> 00:00:54.881 
What kind of things do we get?

00:00:55.478 --> 00:00:57.247 
(The Cafeteria Bread Is Too Expensive)
Let's start with the first one.

00:00:57.443 --> 00:00:58.554 
(Baseball Club)
Take it up with Student Affairs.

00:00:58.578 --> 00:01:00.076 
(The Baseball Field Is Too Small)
That was the second one.

00:01:00.165 --> 00:01:01.583 
(Baseball Club)
Two from the same club?

00:01:02.158 --> 00:01:04.145 
(Receipt)
And the third one was a receipt.

00:01:04.169 --> 00:01:05.845 
Why are they so worked up over bread?

00:01:05.963 --> 00:01:07.372 
This thing's basically
the Baseball Club's box now.

00:01:07.445 --> 00:01:11.219 
We should probably do more to promote
the suggestion box.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.702 
For Komaro's sake, too.

00:01:13.527 --> 00:01:15.607 
Then I'll put up an announcement
on the bulletin board...

00:01:15.631 --> 00:01:17.043 
The bulletin board?!

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:19.283 
That's so lame. So analog!

00:01:19.336 --> 00:01:20.199 
Oh, shut up.

00:01:20.232 --> 00:01:21.883 
No way! Nobody wants to read a bunch of text!

00:01:21.907 --> 00:01:24.034 
They won't even read a single line.

00:01:24.185 --> 00:01:26.412 
Short-form videos are all the rage now.

00:01:26.436 --> 00:01:28.323 
Get a celebrity and a catchy song.

00:01:28.347 --> 00:01:30.127 
Keep it short and easy to understand.

00:01:30.838 --> 00:01:32.421 
That actually makes sense...

00:01:32.956 --> 00:01:35.258 
Lucky for you, I'll do it for just 20,000 yen.

00:01:35.863 --> 00:01:37.485 
(Ototori Tan, 140K Followers)
You're the celebrity?!

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:39.754 
But a short video, huh?

00:01:39.778 --> 00:01:41.467 
That might actually work.

00:01:42.006 --> 00:01:44.113 
Then how about making it a comedy skit?

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:44.737 
Huh?

00:01:44.761 --> 00:01:46.486 
I love comedy!

00:01:46.684 --> 00:01:48.569 
People remember things that make them laugh.

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.655 
So it'd be good publicity, too.

00:01:50.802 --> 00:01:52.429 
Oh, really?

00:01:52.569 --> 00:01:53.777 
Didn't see that coming.

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:55.017 
Mm-hmm!

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.044 
I've never actually done
a comedy skit before, though.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.257 
But sure, let's do it.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.862 
Stop acting like you're some big celebrity.

00:02:00.017 --> 00:02:01.483 
Since it's a suggestion box...

00:02:01.507 --> 00:02:03.471 
Let's turn it into an advice show!

00:02:03.575 --> 00:02:04.522 
Like this!

00:02:05.248 --> 00:02:06.649 
How's this gonna turn out?

00:02:06.933 --> 00:02:09.177 
(Tan's Room)

00:02:09.604 --> 00:02:11.458 
All right, let's get this show on the road!

00:02:11.482 --> 00:02:13.562 
Welcome to the advice corner
with your irresistibly cute host!

00:02:13.726 --> 00:02:17.682 
As always, I'm here to spread the love
to everyone around the world!

00:02:17.706 --> 00:02:19.540 
Now, let's hear today's question...

00:02:31.213 --> 00:02:32.680 
Hey.

00:02:32.722 --> 00:02:35.122 
Why are you barging into my fantasy?!

00:02:35.231 --> 00:02:35.817 
Huh?

00:02:35.841 --> 00:02:37.329 
W-was that not okay?

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:41.229 
I thought starting with some random nonsense
would get a laugh...

00:02:41.344 --> 00:02:42.002 
(Dejected)

00:02:42.082 --> 00:02:45.717 
That kind of gag can cause
a whole controversy. Let's not.

00:02:45.879 --> 00:02:48.002 
Comedians don't even slap
each other around anymore.

00:02:48.026 --> 00:02:49.702 
R-really?

00:02:49.833 --> 00:02:51.293 
But it was so cute...

00:02:51.317 --> 00:02:52.638 
Then how about this?

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.948 
(Throws a Pie During the Intro)
Hello...

00:02:55.051 --> 00:02:57.162 
(Throws a Pie During the Intro)
Can someone turn her off?!

00:02:58.293 --> 00:02:59.897 
This is a disaster.

00:03:00.042 --> 00:03:03.211 
Oh, Komaro, got any good ideas?

00:03:03.404 --> 00:03:06.280 
Huh? Sorry, I was thinking about something else.

00:03:06.304 --> 00:03:07.762 
I'm reading the suggestion slips.

00:03:07.786 --> 00:03:09.311 
You're still reading those stupid complaints?

00:03:09.555 --> 00:03:13.195 
I can't figure out how to make the field bigger.

00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:15.720 
Maybe if everyone pulled on it together.

00:03:15.926 --> 00:03:17.473 
Wait, that won't work.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.337 
Yeah...

00:03:19.671 --> 00:03:21.849 
I'm not strong enough.

00:03:21.966 --> 00:03:23.980 
That's not what I meant!

00:03:24.509 --> 00:03:25.678 
Well...

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:28.053 
You don't have to take it so seriously.

00:03:28.253 --> 00:03:31.115 
Whoever dropped it in probably wasn't
expecting us to move mountains.

00:03:31.422 --> 00:03:34.473 
Y-yeah, but...

00:03:34.497 --> 00:03:37.147 
They took the time to share how they feel, so...

00:03:37.367 --> 00:03:39.922 
There you go again.

00:03:42.162 --> 00:03:43.188 
You're right.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.955 
Even if we can't make the field bigger,

00:03:45.017 --> 00:03:47.324 
there must be something
we can do for the baseball club.

00:03:49.349 --> 00:03:50.473 
Thanks.

00:03:51.754 --> 00:03:53.709 
Michinoku.

00:03:56.895 --> 00:03:58.567 
Are you okay?

00:03:58.591 --> 00:04:00.882 
The ball went straight into your stomach!

00:04:00.906 --> 00:04:03.267 
Sorry! Is there a baseball?

00:04:04.598 --> 00:04:05.544 
Gah!

00:04:05.909 --> 00:04:07.984 
(Suggestion Box)
Please send us your suggestions!

00:04:08.008 --> 00:04:10.331 
Please send us your suggestions!

00:04:10.355 --> 00:04:13.451 
Please send us your suggestions!

00:04:13.796 --> 00:04:15.747 
- Is this a fundraiser or something?
- We got a ton!

00:04:15.885 --> 00:04:18.601 
Thanks to the Baseball Club's
enthusiastic cooperation,

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:20.930 
the suggestion box became a huge success.

00:04:21.076 --> 00:04:23.232 
Don't know what love is?

00:04:23.256 --> 00:04:24.743 
Easy! Easy!

00:04:24.767 --> 00:04:27.154 
First, just look at me!

00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:30.052 
That's it!

00:04:30.076 --> 00:04:33.087 
That feeling you just had? That's love!

00:04:33.235 --> 00:04:35.483 
Oh... I see?

00:04:35.507 --> 00:04:37.534 
(Records Room)
Whew. Thanks!

00:04:37.769 --> 00:04:40.285 
That was urgent, so you really saved me.

00:04:40.309 --> 00:04:41.101 
Not at all.

00:04:41.241 --> 00:04:43.303 
I'm glad I could help.

00:04:43.745 --> 00:04:45.243 
You two haven't had lunch yet, right?

00:04:45.514 --> 00:04:47.163 
Let me treat you both as a thank-you.

00:04:47.323 --> 00:04:48.465 
Let's hit the cafeteria.

00:04:48.561 --> 00:04:50.107 
Huh? Are you sure?

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:52.311 
I haven't been to the cafeteria in ages.

00:04:53.263 --> 00:04:55.387 
They've really gone all-out with the menu lately.

00:04:55.623 --> 00:04:59.716 
Like those limited-time rice bowls
with exotic delicacies from around the world.

00:05:00.105 --> 00:05:01.301 
Hmm?

00:05:01.325 --> 00:05:04.141 
I wonder if they'll be good enough
to satisfy my refined palate.

00:05:04.234 --> 00:05:05.523 
Where'd you come from?!

00:05:06.801 --> 00:05:08.659 
It's packed in here.

00:05:08.879 --> 00:05:10.092 
Sure is.

00:05:10.223 --> 00:05:12.783 
Now, what should I get for free?

00:05:12.876 --> 00:05:14.707 
You didn't do any of the work!

00:05:15.092 --> 00:05:16.483 
Oh, President!

00:05:16.596 --> 00:05:18.067 
- President!
- President!

00:05:18.167 --> 00:05:19.948 
(Energetic)
Thanks so much for the other day!

00:05:19.972 --> 00:05:21.205 
Same here!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.579 
Let's go bowling again sometime!

00:05:23.037 --> 00:05:25.557 
- The president's so popular!
- I'd love to!

00:05:25.585 --> 00:05:26.983 
No wonder.

00:05:27.007 --> 00:05:28.527 
She's capable and so kind.

00:05:28.551 --> 00:05:30.034 
And she's got the looks, too.

00:05:30.194 --> 00:05:31.314 
Oh, right!

00:05:31.452 --> 00:05:33.003 
Ume is a "with" guy, huh?

00:05:34.181 --> 00:05:35.195 
(Napolitan Spaghetti, Hamburg Steak, Croquettes)

00:05:35.219 --> 00:05:37.436 
Pick whatever you like.

00:05:37.696 --> 00:05:39.039 
Anything I want?

00:05:40.312 --> 00:05:42.228 
Then I'll have this one.

00:05:42.314 --> 00:05:43.923 
(Mini Omurice, ¥350)
Huh?

00:05:44.139 --> 00:05:47.261 
Since I'm treating you, you can get
something a little nicer.

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:49.112 
I'm so happy!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.370 
I've been saving up to try this for ages.

00:05:54.445 --> 00:05:55.810 
You're way too modest.

00:05:55.956 --> 00:05:57.867 
What do you usually eat?

00:05:58.836 --> 00:06:00.210 
(Weird Food Rice Bowl)
"Weird Food Rice Bowl"?

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:01.636 
Who'd want to eat that?

00:06:01.745 --> 00:06:04.705 
"Dried mullet roe, shirako,
and sea squirt."

00:06:05.147 --> 00:06:06.054 
(Beep)

00:06:07.121 --> 00:06:07.935 
(Summer Vegetable Set Meal)

00:06:08.143 --> 00:06:09.850 
What did you order, President?

00:06:10.354 --> 00:06:13.550 
Oh, um... the summer vegetable set.

00:06:13.574 --> 00:06:17.085 
You work out and eat healthy, too?
You're so disciplined.

00:06:18.052 --> 00:06:21.052 
Yeah. The vegetables are especially good
this time of year.

00:06:21.076 --> 00:06:22.187 
Eggplant, for example.

00:06:22.211 --> 00:06:23.210 
Oh, Hisako!

00:06:23.234 --> 00:06:26.032 
The usual special beef bowl today?
I'll give you an extra-large serving!

00:06:27.905 --> 00:06:30.865 
And that's how she ended up with
an extra-large serving.

00:06:31.159 --> 00:06:33.110 
(An Extra-Large Serving After All)
Let's eat!

00:06:39.265 --> 00:06:40.540 
What's wrong, Michinoku?

00:06:41.136 --> 00:06:43.039 
Th-the little flag...

00:06:43.063 --> 00:06:43.656 
Huh?

00:06:45.065 --> 00:06:46.100 
Oh!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:54.763 
It's delicious...

00:06:55.443 --> 00:06:57.176 
Excuse me, could I have a flag?

00:07:01.481 --> 00:07:02.939 
Whoa, a tomato!

00:07:02.963 --> 00:07:03.859 
(Cherry Tomato)

00:07:04.076 --> 00:07:05.210 
I hate these.

00:07:05.234 --> 00:07:08.505 
The inside's all mushy and slimy,
but the skin's weirdly crisp.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.676 
Didn't you order it yourself?

00:07:13.027 --> 00:07:15.010 
Here, I'll eat it for you.

00:07:15.092 --> 00:07:16.425 
It's fine.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.479 
Someone's treating me to lunch...

00:07:18.503 --> 00:07:19.899 
So I should eat it.

00:07:19.936 --> 00:07:22.074 
At least you've got the right idea.

00:07:24.587 --> 00:07:25.734 
It's good, though.

00:07:25.758 --> 00:07:28.736 
But summer vegetables alone
aren't quite enough with rice.

00:07:28.912 --> 00:07:31.787 
Oh, I brought some pickles.

00:07:31.887 --> 00:07:33.512 
I made them myself. Please, have some.

00:07:33.536 --> 00:07:34.981 
You made these?

00:07:35.005 --> 00:07:37.047 
Then I'll try a little.

00:07:39.218 --> 00:07:40.472 
Yum!

00:07:40.661 --> 00:07:43.239 
There's this way to make rice-bran pickles
in a food container.

00:07:43.263 --> 00:07:44.439 
So I thought I'd give it a try.

00:07:46.534 --> 00:07:48.636 
Mmm, these are Ume-licious!

00:07:48.839 --> 00:07:50.412 
- Ume's pickles.
- Pickles.

00:07:55.854 --> 00:07:57.041 
Is something wrong?

00:07:57.201 --> 00:07:58.819 
Are you full already?

00:07:58.865 --> 00:08:00.136 
Oh, no.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:02.603 
I was just watching everyone enjoy their food.

00:08:02.747 --> 00:08:04.725 
And thinking I'm glad I treated you all.

00:08:05.247 --> 00:08:07.856 
Guess I'm full in more ways than one.

00:08:08.694 --> 00:08:10.103 
Hisako...

00:08:10.212 --> 00:08:12.634 
Then I'll take the fried chicken on top!

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:18.079 
I wish Arisu could've joined us.

00:08:18.239 --> 00:08:20.176 
Did she have something else to do?

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:21.052 
Yeah.

00:08:21.076 --> 00:08:23.907 
(Chemistry Club)
She's got some club stuff to take care of.

00:08:23.931 --> 00:08:25.383 
She's in the Chemistry Club, right?

00:08:25.539 --> 00:08:27.214 
That's impressive.

00:08:27.445 --> 00:08:29.987 
She's always working right through break.

00:08:30.011 --> 00:08:32.347 
I wonder if she ever gets to eat lunch.

00:08:32.414 --> 00:08:34.481 
Oh, isn't that Arisu over there?

00:08:34.827 --> 00:08:35.681 
Huh?

00:08:36.003 --> 00:08:37.416 
(Sneaking Away)
Oh, yeah.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.976 
But what's with that...

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.754 
(Plop)
Why's she sneaking around like that?

00:08:46.496 --> 00:08:48.287 
That's the Exotic Delicacy Rice Bowl!

00:08:48.311 --> 00:08:49.523 
Huh? Really?

00:08:49.547 --> 00:08:51.065 
Terui ordered that?

00:09:05.741 --> 00:09:08.390 
I don't have the guts to go say hi.

00:09:08.585 --> 00:09:12.536 
Terui probably needs a way to unwind, too.

00:09:13.503 --> 00:09:17.476 
And so, everyone got to see
another side of Terui.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:20.979 
(I Actually Like Ponytails)

00:09:21.467 --> 00:09:23.347 
(Student Council Room)
Take a look at this.

00:09:23.371 --> 00:09:24.027 
Huh?

00:09:24.323 --> 00:09:26.345 
The Light Music Club next door is too loud?

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:27.663 
(Tea Ceremony Club (British-Style))

00:09:27.687 --> 00:09:28.494 
Yes.

00:09:29.625 --> 00:09:30.883 
That's right.

00:09:30.981 --> 00:09:34.363 
But the Light Music Club has to practice,
so there's not much we can do.

00:09:34.472 --> 00:09:36.570 
No, please hear me out!

00:09:36.861 --> 00:09:39.065 
It's not just ordinary noise.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:42.285 
How do I put this? There are screams.

00:09:42.547 --> 00:09:45.231 
Like someone being bullied or something.

00:09:45.255 --> 00:09:46.327 
Bullied?

00:09:47.087 --> 00:09:48.123 
It's hot...

00:09:48.356 --> 00:09:50.587 
Then that's serious!

00:09:50.705 --> 00:09:52.985 
Ah, but that's not quite it!

00:09:53.201 --> 00:09:56.205 
It's not exactly ordinary bullying.

00:09:56.743 --> 00:10:00.725 
It's more... passionate and a little lewd.

00:10:02.492 --> 00:10:05.843 
You know, the kind of stuff below the belt.

00:10:05.867 --> 00:10:07.061 
Below the belt?!

00:10:07.312 --> 00:10:10.312 
(Episode 4: Koki and the Light Music Club)

00:10:10.401 --> 00:10:12.645 
(Light Music Club)
Still, even if that's the case...

00:10:12.841 --> 00:10:15.001 
How am I even supposed to check?

00:10:15.307 --> 00:10:17.032 
Everyone's busy.

00:10:17.107 --> 00:10:19.290 
I don't think I can handle it alone.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.654 
Besides, when it comes
to the Light Music Club...

00:10:23.652 --> 00:10:25.163 
Whatever. I'll go in first.

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:26.565 
I'm getting used to this.

00:10:27.361 --> 00:10:29.045 
Excuse me!

00:10:31.876 --> 00:10:37.236 
♪ What they call love ♪

00:10:37.276 --> 00:10:38.372 
♪ Sometimes falls apart...♪

00:10:38.405 --> 00:10:41.623 
A clear, beautiful voice rings out
under the autumn sky.

00:10:41.905 --> 00:10:43.341 
A breeze blows through...

00:10:44.352 --> 00:10:47.332 
And that tapping foot...

00:10:47.654 --> 00:10:48.730 
So cool.

00:10:48.754 --> 00:10:53.952 
♪ There's no answer there ♪

00:10:54.249 --> 00:11:00.909 
♪ But if it's not you, it means nothing ♪

00:11:10.302 --> 00:11:11.293 
Hmm?

00:11:11.451 --> 00:11:12.451 
Oh!

00:11:13.239 --> 00:11:14.145 
What's up?

00:11:14.169 --> 00:11:15.754 
S-sorry!

00:11:15.785 --> 00:11:17.114 
I got a little carried away watching.

00:11:17.634 --> 00:11:19.830 
Can you play?

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.734 
Huh? You mean guitar?

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:25.559 
I tried it once a while back...

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:26.857 
Hmm?

00:11:29.317 --> 00:11:30.525 
Come sit here.

00:11:30.732 --> 00:11:31.701 
Huh?

00:11:34.548 --> 00:11:36.099 
Like this?

00:11:36.219 --> 00:11:37.205 
Yeah.

00:11:37.474 --> 00:11:39.240 
Not bad. You're starting to look like a guitarist.

00:11:39.292 --> 00:11:40.843 
What's going on here?

00:11:41.372 --> 00:11:43.203 
I'm Koki.

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:44.965 
Thinking of joining the club?

00:11:45.183 --> 00:11:46.712 
Huh? Uh...

00:11:47.261 --> 00:11:49.234 
Well...

00:12:00.988 --> 00:12:03.734 
- Quit making it all romantic!
- Quit making it all romantic!

00:12:03.758 --> 00:12:05.048 
I can't let this slide.

00:12:05.072 --> 00:12:06.964 
And don't let her reel you in!

00:12:06.988 --> 00:12:10.552 
She knew you'd show up, so she started
pretending to play guitar!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.289 
That's not true!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.090 
She always tries to look cool when she's alone.

00:12:15.105 --> 00:12:16.714 
You're hopeless, too.

00:12:16.738 --> 00:12:19.436 
Don't fall for this pudding-head's little act!

00:12:19.928 --> 00:12:21.799 
Still, make sure you get some good shots!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:23.894 
Not bad. You're starting to look like a guitarist.

00:12:23.918 --> 00:12:25.935 
Yeah, good thing we let them have their moment.

00:12:25.959 --> 00:12:27.657 
- You guys...
- Not bad. You're starting to look like a guitarist.

00:12:27.794 --> 00:12:30.101 
Aren't you on the Student Council?

00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:31.397 
What are you doing here?

00:12:31.421 --> 00:12:33.141 
Uh, well...

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:34.423 
Here about the club budget again?

00:12:34.447 --> 00:12:38.143 
Oh, so that's what this is about...

00:12:38.167 --> 00:12:40.105 
Huh? You forgot already?

00:12:40.129 --> 00:12:42.788 
He confiscated your
dirty magazines before, remember?

00:12:45.085 --> 00:12:47.148 
Oh, she's really trying...

00:12:47.172 --> 00:12:51.012 
Acting all high and mighty, lecturing someone
who knows her embarrassing secrets.

00:12:51.036 --> 00:12:52.434 
She's gotta be dying inside.

00:12:52.458 --> 00:12:54.165 
Stop narrating me!

00:12:54.441 --> 00:12:56.983 
I'm here because someone complained
about the noise...

00:12:57.007 --> 00:12:58.232 
Noise?

00:12:58.256 --> 00:13:00.503 
We're the Light Music Club. What do you expect?

00:13:00.527 --> 00:13:02.799 
Well, that's true, but...

00:13:03.397 --> 00:13:08.308 
Apparently there's some very suggestive screaming,
like someone's being bullied.

00:13:08.332 --> 00:13:10.066 
W-w-w-wha...

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:12.692 
Who would do something like that?!

00:13:12.968 --> 00:13:14.519 
I see.

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.343 
But...

00:13:17.628 --> 00:13:19.490 
What's with all the bedding and tissues?

00:13:19.514 --> 00:13:20.545 
Huh?

00:13:20.577 --> 00:13:21.919 
For naps, obviously.

00:13:21.943 --> 00:13:23.665 
We hang out in here before concerts.

00:13:23.697 --> 00:13:26.025 
And the tissues are because Koki cries a lot.

00:13:26.049 --> 00:13:27.463 
Like, full-on sobbing.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:34.694 
I swear, this thing's just for shoulder massages!

00:13:34.718 --> 00:13:36.748 
You haven't even done anything,
and the evidence is already piling up!

00:13:38.541 --> 00:13:39.670 
(Sniffle)

00:13:39.676 --> 00:13:40.490 
Oh!

00:13:40.514 --> 00:13:43.041 
Look what you've done, interrogating her like that!

00:13:43.265 --> 00:13:46.057 
You've completely crushed Koki's dignity!

00:13:46.081 --> 00:13:47.941 
I-I'm sorry.

00:13:48.208 --> 00:13:50.777 
But when you were singing
and playing guitar at the same time,

00:13:51.368 --> 00:13:54.110 
you were seriously cool.

00:13:54.163 --> 00:13:55.914 
You, honestly.

00:13:55.938 --> 00:13:57.548 
You can't just say stuff like that.

00:13:59.628 --> 00:14:02.432 
- Quit making it all romantic!
- Quit making it all romantic!

00:14:02.456 --> 00:14:05.164 
B-but, about the singing and guitar...

00:14:05.188 --> 00:14:06.305 
Shut up, you idiot!

00:14:06.329 --> 00:14:08.110 
Did you already forget how embarrassed you were?!

00:14:09.479 --> 00:14:10.723 
In the end...

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:15.680 
Mizunoe agreed to drop by and check in,
and learn guitar from time to time.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:19.468 
Good work. Sorry I made you go alone.

00:14:19.688 --> 00:14:20.896 
Oh, it's fine.

00:14:21.045 --> 00:14:22.614 
Actually, going alone was better.

00:14:22.741 --> 00:14:23.554 
Huh?

00:14:23.578 --> 00:14:27.152 
W-w-w-what was that about?

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.205 
It's so dusty in here.

00:14:32.348 --> 00:14:33.397 
Tell me about it.

00:14:33.917 --> 00:14:36.903 
We're on cleanup duty,
so they dumped this job on us.

00:14:37.412 --> 00:14:39.625 
Like PE wasn't exhausting enough already.

00:14:39.848 --> 00:14:40.781 
Right?

00:14:41.492 --> 00:14:45.523 
You took a ball right to the face, Michinoku.

00:14:48.017 --> 00:14:49.688 
I was so worried about you.

00:14:49.972 --> 00:14:51.163 
Really?

00:14:51.441 --> 00:14:53.845 
But getting hit in the face doesn't count.

00:14:53.983 --> 00:14:56.139 
I got to keep playing. It was fun!

00:14:56.163 --> 00:14:58.639 
Oh. Well, that's good, then.

00:14:59.017 --> 00:15:00.319 
Okay, all done.

00:15:00.343 --> 00:15:01.474 
Let's get back to class.

00:15:04.268 --> 00:15:05.365 
Huh?

00:15:11.139 --> 00:15:13.125 
It won't open. Why not?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:14.897 
Oh!

00:15:15.199 --> 00:15:18.332 
Once this door shuts,
you can't open it from inside.

00:15:18.419 --> 00:15:19.983 
Who installed a door like that?!

00:15:20.007 --> 00:15:21.854 
I've been here since middle school
and never heard that!

00:15:23.772 --> 00:15:26.474 
I get locked in here all the time.

00:15:26.498 --> 00:15:28.403 
Guess most people don't know about it.

00:15:28.723 --> 00:15:30.074 
Poor thing.

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:33.870 
They decided to wait
until club activities started.

00:15:35.121 --> 00:15:37.943 
But what a coincidence?\
It's almost like it was all planned.

00:15:38.159 --> 00:15:39.074 
Right?

00:15:39.225 --> 00:15:41.706 
No matter how hard you try,
the door won't budge.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.643 
You yell for help, and nobody comes.

00:15:43.972 --> 00:15:45.305 
Textbook stuff.

00:15:45.643 --> 00:15:48.688 
And it always happens when you need to pee.

00:15:48.812 --> 00:15:50.248 
That part's textbook, too.

00:15:50.637 --> 00:15:51.606 
Wait...

00:15:52.688 --> 00:15:53.790 
Like right now.

00:15:53.818 --> 00:15:54.927 
Seriously?!

00:15:54.951 --> 00:15:56.394 
Come on, let's get this open!

00:15:56.418 --> 00:15:58.279 
Maybe if we both pull, it'll give!

00:16:00.141 --> 00:16:01.901 
It's not moving...

00:16:02.077 --> 00:16:04.352 
Michinoku, give it a little more muscle!

00:16:05.817 --> 00:16:06.825 
I can't...

00:16:06.849 --> 00:16:08.230 
You're giving up way too fast!

00:16:08.603 --> 00:16:10.657 
Sorry, Ume...

00:16:10.954 --> 00:16:11.826 
I can't...

00:16:11.943 --> 00:16:13.759 
Don't give up on that just yet!

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.166 
Let's try that window, then.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.657 
I'll give you a boost on my shoulders.

00:16:18.748 --> 00:16:20.224 
You can get out first.

00:16:20.357 --> 00:16:22.090 
Use the bathroom, then come back and help me.

00:16:22.585 --> 00:16:24.648 
O-okay.

00:16:31.212 --> 00:16:32.670 
Can't reach?

00:16:33.261 --> 00:16:34.892 
I can't reach...

00:16:34.916 --> 00:16:36.770 
J-just a little more! You can do it!

00:16:36.948 --> 00:16:40.205 
I'll hold your legs. Can you stretch up a little more?

00:16:40.505 --> 00:16:41.648 
I can't...

00:16:41.672 --> 00:16:42.877 
W-why not?

00:16:43.137 --> 00:16:44.892 
If I stand up right now,

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.157 
I'll pee myself.

00:16:46.181 --> 00:16:47.610 
Don't pee yourself!

00:16:47.888 --> 00:16:49.239 
Oh, crap...

00:16:50.081 --> 00:16:51.970 
Don't clamp your legs around my neck!

00:16:51.994 --> 00:16:54.752 
Hang in there! You're a girl, for crying out loud!

00:16:56.038 --> 00:16:57.394 
How's it going?

00:16:58.463 --> 00:17:00.632 
You two okay?

00:17:00.812 --> 00:17:03.656 
Tan?! How'd you know we were in here?

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:06.174 
Just a simple deduction, Ume.

00:17:06.959 --> 00:17:10.772 
If something scandalous is going to happen,
it's always in the equipment room.

00:17:10.796 --> 00:17:12.690 
So I secretly installed a camera.

00:17:13.543 --> 00:17:15.645 
For blackmail and resale, obviously.

00:17:16.112 --> 00:17:17.552 
Deduction, huh?

00:17:19.763 --> 00:17:23.119 
I didn't expect the door to work like this, though.

00:17:23.143 --> 00:17:25.217 
Anyway, something must be jammed...

00:17:25.517 --> 00:17:26.539 
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:17:29.303 --> 00:17:30.868 
Oh?

00:17:32.461 --> 00:17:34.079 
With three of us, we'll find a way out!

00:17:34.103 --> 00:17:35.990 
I've already tried everything, damn it!

00:17:36.941 --> 00:17:39.550 
My arms and legs are totally shot...

00:17:39.845 --> 00:17:42.299 
Too bad. Michinoku's at her limit.

00:17:42.323 --> 00:17:44.485 
Huh? Is it that bad? Sorry!

00:17:44.509 --> 00:17:47.005 
Um... Oh!

00:17:47.865 --> 00:17:49.092 
Hey, I found some tape!

00:17:49.116 --> 00:17:51.472 
What, you want to tape it shut? You've lost it!

00:17:51.914 --> 00:17:54.137 
That'll hurt like hell to peel off.

00:17:54.161 --> 00:17:54.952 
No, thanks.

00:17:54.976 --> 00:17:56.439 
That's your reason for saying no?

00:17:56.637 --> 00:17:58.481 
Ume, hold this for me.

00:17:58.505 --> 00:18:00.239 
No way that's gonna work.

00:18:00.637 --> 00:18:02.424 
Oh, there's a window over there!

00:18:02.448 --> 00:18:03.579 
I already tried it, damn it!

00:18:03.999 --> 00:18:06.568 
We got some great data today,
didn't we, assistant?

00:18:06.592 --> 00:18:08.083 
Yes, senpai.

00:18:10.172 --> 00:18:10.985 
Huh?

00:18:14.303 --> 00:18:15.357 
What's that?

00:18:15.645 --> 00:18:16.499 
Oh!

00:18:23.385 --> 00:18:24.950 
Oh, thank goodness...

00:18:24.974 --> 00:18:27.405 
They're mating!

00:18:27.457 --> 00:18:30.275 
(Whoosh)
They're mating!

00:18:30.868 --> 00:18:33.148 
W-wait a second!

00:18:33.608 --> 00:18:35.779 
Sure, a weird rumor spread,

00:18:35.803 --> 00:18:37.670 
but at least she made it to the bathroom.

00:18:38.797 --> 00:18:41.134 
(They're mating!)
"They're mating!"

00:18:49.234 --> 00:18:52.678 
(The Student Council Leaks)

00:20:11.206 --> 00:20:12.930 
(Student Council Room)
Good work today.

00:20:13.183 --> 00:20:14.868 
It's so hot today, isn't it?

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.104 
Hmm?

00:20:18.752 --> 00:20:22.223 
Goodness, he does seem pretty busy lately.

00:20:22.577 --> 00:20:23.692 
Hey.

00:20:23.786 --> 00:20:26.537 
Mizunoe. Hey...

00:20:30.114 --> 00:20:32.452 
You'll catch a cold if you sleep like that.

00:20:32.476 --> 00:20:34.114 
(Gently)
Darling...

00:20:34.138 --> 00:20:35.608 
Just kidding!

00:20:35.632 --> 00:20:36.946 
Good work today.

00:20:37.279 --> 00:20:38.954 
What are you doing, Kotobuki?

00:20:39.106 --> 00:20:40.261 
(Garden Eel)
Doing a garden eel impression?

00:20:40.285 --> 00:20:41.521 
No, I'm not!

00:20:41.943 --> 00:20:44.841 
Anyway, what brings you here, Ms. Hiratsuka?

00:20:44.968 --> 00:20:46.586 
Oh, right.

00:20:46.739 --> 00:20:50.214 
It's about our annual event.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:53.679 
You know, that thing... What was it called?

00:20:53.725 --> 00:20:56.479 
(Boom! Komaro)
The student council bonding retreat!

00:20:57.115 --> 00:20:59.280 
Oh, it's that time of year already.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:00.647 
Yeah, that's it!

00:21:00.702 --> 00:21:03.364 
That's what I wanted to discuss.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:06.245 
Why's that one sleeping like
he's at a hot spring?

00:21:06.269 --> 00:21:06.975 
Huh?

00:21:06.999 --> 00:21:10.689 
That pretty face with that getup.

00:21:10.713 --> 00:21:11.598 
It's kind of hilarious

00:21:11.835 --> 00:21:13.266 
I know what you mean.

00:21:13.678 --> 00:21:15.815 
I'll wake him up.

00:21:15.949 --> 00:21:18.775 
Hey, Ume. Wake up.

00:21:19.622 --> 00:21:22.440 
Aw, Sis, leave me alone...

00:21:23.375 --> 00:21:26.376 
Aw, just let him sleep, Sis.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.482 
Ms. Hiratsuka?

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.304 
(Ume Is Awake)
Mizunoe's awake.

00:21:29.328 --> 00:21:31.198 
Ah, sorry about that.

00:21:31.222 --> 00:21:33.571 
Guess the exhaustion finally caught up with me.

00:21:33.595 --> 00:21:36.347 
Don't worry about it. I nod off all the time, too.

00:21:36.649 --> 00:21:39.742 
So, this is about the student council
bonding retreat?

00:21:39.918 --> 00:21:40.833 
That's right.

00:21:40.857 --> 00:21:43.342 
If there's somewhere you'd like to go, Ume,
I feel free to suggest it.

00:21:43.366 --> 00:21:44.662 
Really?

00:21:44.698 --> 00:21:46.973 
Then how about a hot spring?

00:21:46.997 --> 00:21:48.395 
Like the kind Yasunari Kawabata wrote about.

00:21:48.961 --> 00:21:50.735 
You really love baths, don't you?

00:21:50.759 --> 00:21:53.518 
Huh? Wait, did I say that before?

00:21:53.698 --> 00:21:55.567 
Sorry, Mizunoe.

00:21:56.262 --> 00:21:57.809 
W-what about you, Michinoku?

00:21:58.511 --> 00:22:01.884 
Yeah, I'd like to try a hot spring, too.

00:22:01.911 --> 00:22:03.738 
Oh, you don't have to agree
just because I said so.

00:22:03.762 --> 00:22:07.589 
I love soaking in hot water.
It makes me feel lighter.

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:10.631 
I love hot springs too!

00:22:10.787 --> 00:22:12.493 
(Smack)
Though my boobs are pretty light!

00:22:12.649 --> 00:22:13.564 
That's enough.

00:22:13.934 --> 00:22:16.351 
Then it's settled. Hot springs it is!

00:22:16.438 --> 00:22:18.798 
(Yay, Excited, Giggling, Beaming)
Huh? Are you sure this is okay?

00:22:18.891 --> 00:22:21.896 
Well, I'll have to chaperone
the students anyway...

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:24.778 
So getting a free hot-spring trip chosen
by the students...

00:22:25.049 --> 00:22:26.707 
(Score! Score!)
- That's a pretty sweet deal!
- You said the quiet part out loud.

00:22:26.944 --> 00:22:29.202 
Besides, it's still better than last year.

00:22:29.422 --> 00:22:31.035 
Huh? Last year?

00:22:31.059 --> 00:22:33.553 
Last year, Otori wouldn't stop begging to go,

00:22:33.577 --> 00:22:35.251 
so we went to see Mount Fuji.

00:22:35.275 --> 00:22:36.913 
I want one!

00:22:37.131 --> 00:22:39.135 
I'll arrange the lodging, then.

00:22:39.159 --> 00:22:40.411 
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:22:40.435 --> 00:22:41.709 
- Sure.
- Got it!

00:22:41.969 --> 00:22:44.267 
(Rurubu Travel Guide)
Oh, one last thing.

00:22:44.291 --> 00:22:45.111 
Hmm?

00:22:45.495 --> 00:22:48.927 
Don't let those teenage hormones get the better
of you and do anything you'll regret.

00:22:48.951 --> 00:22:50.500 
You're all at that age, after all.

00:22:50.524 --> 00:22:52.075 
That's your last piece of advice?!

00:22:52.275 --> 00:22:54.307 
Nothing like that is going to happen!

00:22:54.331 --> 00:22:55.522 
That's sexual harassment, you know.

00:22:55.546 --> 00:22:56.473 
Is it?

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.929 
But seeing someone in a more private setting

00:22:58.930 --> 00:23:00.278 
might be too much for you to handle...

00:23:00.306 --> 00:23:01.395 
No way!

00:23:01.437 --> 00:23:04.542 
Or maybe you'll sneak a few touches
under cover of darkness...

00:23:04.832 --> 00:23:06.895 
Who would do that?!

00:23:06.928 --> 00:23:09.967 
Or take advantage while the other person's asleep!

00:23:10.366 --> 00:23:12.155 
You've been reading too much manga!

00:23:12.179 --> 00:23:14.316 
Good grief. What nonsense...

00:23:14.774 --> 00:23:15.677 
Hmm?

00:23:16.692 --> 00:23:17.550 
(Puff, Puff)
President?

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:20.394 
(Puff, Puff)
No! I wasn't thinking that...

00:23:20.705 --> 00:23:24.114 
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?
You're puffing like a steam engine!

00:23:24.363 --> 00:23:26.652 
(Puff, Puff)
If you're gonna do it, just don't get caught.

00:23:27.543 --> 00:23:28.245 
I'm off!

00:23:28.545 --> 00:23:29.699 
So you're just going with that?!

00:23:29.723 --> 00:23:31.496 
- Did she figure it out? No, wait...
- Sis, dinner's ready!

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:33.072 
- But...
- It's so hot!

00:23:33.096 --> 00:23:34.205 
(Puff, Puff)
What's with this room?!

00:23:35.034 --> 00:23:36.039 
(Next Episode Preview)

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:38.250 
(Student Council Retreat)
(Sharing an Umbrella with Ume in the Rain)

